('P126-BREATH-ANS','BREATHING','NEURO_AUTONOMIC','respiratory-autonomic regulation','NORMALIZE','UPSTREAM_CONVERGENCE','PLAUSIBLE','NO_DIRECT_PSO','Breathing practices can alter autonomic physiology in other contexts and overlap the same ANS/HPA control zone.','No psoriasis-specific direct-treatment evidence; mechanism claim requires HRV/cortisol plus skin change.','respiratory rate; HRV; stress; sleep; PASI','STRESS_REGULATION','COND_ANS'),
